{"abstract":"Lactococcus lactis subsp. lactis NCDO 2118 is a nondairy lactic acid bacterium, a xylose fermenter, and a gamma-aminobutyric acid (GABA) producer isolated from frozen peas. Here, we report the complete genome sequence of L. lactis NCDO 2118, a strain with probiotic potential activity.","author_count":40,"contributors":["Oliveira, Letícia C","Saraiva, Tessália D L","Soares, Siomar C","Ramos, Rommel T J","Sá, Pablo H C G","Carneiro, Adriana R","Miranda, Fábio","Freire, Matheus","Renan, Wendel","Júnior, Alberto F O","Santos, Anderson R","Pinto, Anne C","Souza, Bianca M","Castro, Camila P","Diniz, Carlos A A","Rocha, Clarissa S","Mariano, Diego C B","de Aguiar, Edgar L","Folador, Edson L","Barbosa, Eudes","Aburjaile, Flavia F","Gonçalves, Lucas A","Guimarães, Luís C","Azevedo, Marcela","Agresti, Pamela C M","Silva, Renata F","Tiwari, Sandeep","Almeida, Sintia S","Hassan, Syed S","Pereira, Vanessa B","Abreu, Vinicius A C","Pereira, Ulisses P","Dorella, Fernanda A","Carvalho, Alex F","Pereira, Felipe L","Leal, Carlos A G","Figueiredo, Henrique C P","Silva, Artur","Miyoshi, Anderson","Azevedo, Vasco"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-606807"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, South"],"country":["Brazil"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Federal University of Minas Gerais","Federal University of Pará"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genome sequence of lactococcus lactis subsp lactis ncdo 000000002118 a gaba producing strain","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1128/genomeA.00980-14","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-606807","identifier":[{"id":"85004060341","type":"scopus"},{"id":